      "content": "# Mechanics\nLet $F$ be force in newtons. Let $m$ be mass in kilograms. Let $a$ be acceleration in metres per second squared.\nThe balance is $F=m a$.\nLet $t$ be duration in seconds. The force rate is $p=F/t$.\nLet $v$ be velocity in metres per second. The invalid balance is $F=m v$.\n"
